<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Carnival started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Carnival started with buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said Tuesday it inititated coverage of Carnival Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional informational was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-3/16 to 43-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
